\midrule
four\_panel        & 49.5\% [46.2--52.7\%] & 51.7\% [48.5--55.0\%] \\
single\_line        & 32.7\% [29.7--35.8\%] & 55.8\% [52.5--59.0\%] \\
heatmap             & 31.4\% [28.5--34.4\%] & 61.7\% [58.5--64.7\%] \\
recurrence\_plot    & 11.1\% [9.2--13.3\%]  & 11.1\% [9.2--13.3\%]  \\
grayscale\_matrix   & 10.8\% [8.9--13.0\%]  & 11.1\% [9.2--13.3\%]  \\
